<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Club De Stars — Membership Agreement</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ══ THEME TOKENS ══ */
:root{
  --sidebar-w:230px;--nav-h:62px;
  --r-sm:8px;--r-md:12px;--r-lg:16px;--r-xl:20px;
  --accent:#4f8ef7;--accent2:#7c5af4;
  --green:#22c78a;--red:#f05252;--amber:#f5a623;
  --tr:all .22s ease;
}
[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0a0f1e;--bg-card:#111827;--bg-card2:#1a2235;
  --bg-card3:rgba(255,255,255,.035);
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,.07);--border2:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  --text:#f0f4ff;--text2:#c8d4f0;--muted:#8b9ab8;
  --nav-bg:rgba(10,15,30,.93);
  --hero-bg:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827 0%,#1a2235 100%);
  --bar-bg:rgba(255,255,255,.07);--meta-bg:rgba(255,255,255,.03);
  --tog-bg:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  --doc-bg:#0d1526;--doc-border:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  --section-num-bg:rgba(79,142,247,.15);--section-num-color:var(--accent);
  --li-marker:rgba(79,142,247,.6);
  --party-a-bg:rgba(79,142,247,.06);--party-a-border:rgba(79,142,247,.2);
  --party-b-bg:rgba(34,199,138,.06);--party-b-border:rgba(34,199,138,.2);
  --sig-bg:rgba(79,142,247,.05);--sig-border:rgba(79,142,247,.15);
  --divider:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  --part-bg:rgba(124,90,244,.08);--part-border:rgba(124,90,244,.2);--part-color:#a48cf8;
}
[data-theme="light"]{
  --bg:#f4f6fb;--bg-card:#ffffff;--bg-card2:#f0f3fa;
  --bg-card3:rgba(0,0,0,.025);
  --border:rgba(0,0,0,.07);--border2:rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  --text:#0f1523;--text2:#2a3550;--muted:#6b7a99;
  --nav-bg:rgba(255,255,255,.93);
  --hero-bg:linear-gradient(135deg,#dde8ff 0%,#eef1ff 100%);
  --bar-bg:rgba(0,0,0,.07);--meta-bg:rgba(0,0,0,.025);
  --tog-bg:rgba(0,0,0,.07);
  --doc-bg:#ffffff;--doc-border:rgba(0,0,0,.07);
  --section-num-bg:rgba(30,58,138,.1);--section-num-color:#1e3a8a;
  --li-marker:rgba(30,58,138,.4);
  --party-a-bg:#eff6ff;--party-a-border:#bfdbfe;
  --party-b-bg:#f0fdf4;--party-b-border:#bbf7d0;
  --sig-bg:#eff6ff;--sig-border:#bfdbfe;
  --divider:rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  --part-bg:#f1edfe;--part-border:#ddd3fb;--part-color:#5b3fc4;
}

/* ══ BASE ══ */
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
html,body{height:100%;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;transition:background .3s,color .3s;}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;}
button,input{font-family:inherit;}

/* ══ LOADER ══ */
#loader{
  position:fixed;inset:0;background:#05101e;z-index:9999;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  flex-direction:column;gap:18px;overflow:hidden;
  transition:opacity .5s;
}
.ld-particles{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;}
.ldp{
  position:absolute;width:2px;height:2px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#5cc8ff;opacity:0;
  animation:ldpDrift var(--dur) ease-in-out var(--delay) infinite;
}
@keyframes ldpDrift{
  0%  {transform:translate(0,0) scale(1);opacity:0;}
  20% {opacity:.5;}
  100%{transform:translate(var(--tx),var(--ty)) scale(0);opacity:0;}
}
.ld-glow{
  position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(92,200,255,.06) 0%,transparent 70%);
  animation:ldGlowP 3s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none;
}
@keyframes ldGlowP{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.6;}50%{transform:scale(1.12);opacity:1;}}
.ld-center{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.ld-ring-wrap{
  width:58px;height:58px;position:relative;opacity:0;
  animation:ldRingIn .55s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .15s forwards;
}
@keyframes ldRingIn{
  from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.45) rotate(-120deg);}
  to  {opacity:1;transform:scale(1) rotate(0);}
}
.ld-ring-svg{width:100%;height:100%;}
.ld-ring-bg  {fill:none;stroke:#0c2236;stroke-width:3;}
.ld-ring-arc {
  fill:none;stroke:#5cc8ff;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;
  stroke-dasharray:127;stroke-dashoffset:127;
  animation:ldArcDraw .9s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .65s forwards;
}
@keyframes ldArcDraw{to{stroke-dashoffset:32;}}
.ld-ring-dot {fill:#5cc8ff;r:0;opacity:0;animation:ldDotPop .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 1.5s forwards;}
@keyframes ldDotPop{to{r:3.5;opacity:1;}}
.ld-ring-orbit{fill:none;stroke:#0d2d45;stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:4 6;animation:ldOrbit 12s linear infinite;transform-origin:29px 29px;}
@keyframes ldOrbit{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
.ld-ring-letter{
  position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#5cc8ff;opacity:0;
  animation:ldLetterPop .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 1.2s forwards;
}
@keyframes ldLetterPop{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.6);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}
.ld-brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;overflow:hidden;height:40px;}
.ld-word{display:flex;}
.ldl{
  font-size:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.5px;display:inline-block;
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px);
  animation:ldlRise .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) var(--ld) forwards;
}
.ldl.w{color:#ffffff;}
.ldl.a{color:#5cc8ff;}
@keyframes ldlRise{to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
.ld-word-gap{width:3px;}

/* ══ SIDEBAR ══ */
.sidebar{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:var(--sidebar-w);background:var(--bg-card);border-right:1px solid var(--border);z-index:200;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .3s,background .3s,border-color .3s;}
.sidebar-logo{padding:18px 18px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-shrink:0;}
.logo-mark{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;flex-shrink:0;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#fff;}
.logo-mark img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.logo-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;}
.logo-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;}
.sidebar-user{padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0;}
.user-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--bg-card2);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border);}
.user-avatar{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;}
.user-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.user-id{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.04em;}
.sidebar-nav{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:8px 10px;}
.sidebar-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{width:3px;}
.sidebar-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border2);border-radius:4px;}
.nav-section{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:10px 8px 4px;margin-top:2px;}
.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;transition:var(--tr);margin-bottom:1px;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;width:100%;text-align:left;}
.nav-item:hover{background:var(--bg-card2);color:var(--text);}
.nav-item.active{background:rgba(79,142,247,.1);color:var(--accent);}
.nav-item i{width:18px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0;}
.nav-badge{margin-left:auto;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;border-radius:20px;padding:2px 7px;}
.sidebar-footer{padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0;}
.member-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(34,199,138,.12);color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(34,199,138,.2);margin-bottom:8px;}

/* ══ TOP NAV ══ */
.topnav{position:fixed;top:0;left:var(--sidebar-w);right:0;height:var(--nav-h);background:var(--nav-bg);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 20px;gap:12px;transition:left .3s,background .3s,border-color .3s;}
.hamburger{display:none;cursor:pointer;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;border:none;background:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;transition:var(--tr);flex-shrink:0;}
.hamburger:hover{background:var(--bg-card2);color:var(--text);}
.topnav-greeting{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.topnav-greeting h2{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.topnav-greeting p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}
.topnav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0;}
.status-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.status-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--green);}
.status-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:500;}
.kyc-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(245,166,35,.1);border:1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.2);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--amber);cursor:pointer;transition:var(--tr);}
.kyc-chip.verified{background:rgba(34,199,138,.08);border-color:rgba(34,199,138,.2);color:var(--green);}
.theme-toggle{width:40px;height:22px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border2);background:var(--tog-bg);cursor:pointer;position:relative;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s;padding:0;}
.tog-thumb{position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--muted);transition:transform .25s ease,background .25s;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#fff;pointer-events:none;}
[data-theme="light"] .tog-thumb{transform:translateX(18px);background:var(--accent);}

/* ══ MAIN ══ */
.main{margin-left:var(--sidebar-w);margin-top:var(--nav-h);padding:22px;min-height:calc(100vh - var(--nav-h));transition:margin-left .3s;}

/* ══ PAGE HEADER ══ */
.breadcrumb-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;}
.breadcrumb-row a{color:var(--accent);transition:var(--tr);}
.breadcrumb-row a:hover{opacity:.75;}
.breadcrumb-row i{font-size:10px;}

/* ══ DOCUMENT WRAPPER ══ */
.doc-wrapper{
  background:var(--doc-bg);border:1px solid var(--doc-border);
  border-radius:var(--r-xl);overflow:hidden;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;
  transition:background .3s,border-color .3s;
}

/* ══ DOC HEADER ══ */
.doc-header{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f1e4a 0%,#1a2e6e 50%,#1e3a8a 100%);
  padding:32px 36px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.doc-header::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-80px;right:-80px;width:220px;height:220px;
  border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(79,142,247,.12) 0%,transparent 70%);
}
.doc-header::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-60px;left:-40px;width:180px;height:180px;
  border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,90,244,.08) 0%,transparent 70%);
}
.doc-header-icon{
  width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);margin:0 auto 14px;
  position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.doc-header h1{font-size:clamp(16px,3.5vw,22px);font-weight:600;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:6px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
.doc-header p{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);position:relative;z-index:1;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;}
.doc-meta-row{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;
  margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.doc-meta-chip{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 12px;
  border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);
}

/* ══ QUICK-JUMP ══ */
.doc-toc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:16px 36px 0;}
.doc-toc a{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;
  background:var(--bg-card3);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);
  transition:var(--tr);
}
.doc-toc a:hover{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);}

/* ══ DOC BODY ══ */
.doc-body{padding:32px 36px;}

/* ══ PARTIES ══ */
.parties-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:28px;}
.party-card{border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:16px;border:1px solid;}
.party-card.a{background:var(--party-a-bg);border-color:var(--party-a-border);}
.party-card.b{background:var(--party-b-bg);border-color:var(--party-b-border);}
.party-tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
.party-tag.a{color:var(--accent);}
.party-tag.b{color:var(--green);}
.party-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.3;}
.party-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;}
.party-ref{font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;}
.party-ref.a{background:rgba(79,142,247,.1);color:var(--accent);}
.party-ref.b{background:rgba(34,199,138,.1);color:var(--green);}
.parties-and{text-align:center;padding:8px 0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);}

/* ══ PART DIVIDER ══ */
.part-divider{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:36px 0 22px;
}
.part-divider .line{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--divider);}
.part-label{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  padding:7px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;
  background:var(--part-bg);border:1px solid var(--part-border);color:var(--part-color);
  white-space:nowrap;
}

/* ══ SECTIONS ══ */
.doc-section{margin-bottom:24px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--divider);scroll-margin-top:80px;}
.doc-section:last-of-type{border-bottom:none;margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0;}
.section-header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.section-num{
  width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;
  background:var(--section-num-bg);color:var(--section-num-color);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
}
.section-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;padding-top:4px;}
.section-body{padding-left:40px;}
.section-body p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px;}
.section-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
.clause-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;}
.clause-list li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.65;}
.clause-marker{
  flex-shrink:0;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:5px;
  background:var(--section-num-bg);color:var(--section-num-color);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:10px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;
}
.clause-list strong{color:var(--text);}

/* ══ SIGNATURES ══ */
.signatures-section{margin-top:28px;}
.sig-intro{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;}
.sig-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.sig-card{
  background:var(--bg-card2);border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:16px;
}
.sig-role{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;}
.sig-img-wrap{height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;}
.sig-img-wrap img{max-height:56px;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;opacity:.85;}
.sig-img-empty{height:48px;border:1px dashed var(--border2);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}
.sig-divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:8px 0;}
.sig-detail{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:3px;}
.sig-detail span{color:var(--text);font-weight:500;}
.member-sig-card{
  background:var(--sig-bg);border:1px solid var(--sig-border);
  border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:20px;
}
.member-sig-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
.member-sig-img{
  height:80px;border:1px dashed var(--border2);border-radius:10px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden;
  background:var(--bg-card2);
}
.member-sig-img img{max-height:76px;object-fit:contain;}
.member-details-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;}
.member-detail-item{background:var(--bg-card2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:10px 12px;}
.member-detail-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin-bottom:3px;}
.member-detail-value{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;word-break:break-word;}

/* ══ ACTIONS ══ */
.doc-actions{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:24px;
  padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--divider);flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.action-btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
  padding:10px 18px;border-radius:var(--r-md);border:1px solid;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:var(--tr);
}
.btn-print{background:var(--bg-card2);border-color:var(--border2);color:var(--muted);}
.btn-print:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(79,142,247,.05);}
.btn-download{background:rgba(34,199,138,.08);border-color:rgba(34,199,138,.2);color:var(--green);}
.btn-download:hover{background:rgba(34,199,138,.14);}

/* ══ POWERED BY ══ */
.powered-by{position:fixed;bottom:12px;right:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);z-index:50;}
.powered-by strong{color:var(--accent);}

/* ══ SIDEBAR OVERLAY ══ */
.sb-overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);z-index:190;}
.sb-overlay.show{display:block;}

/* ══ RESPONSIVE ══ */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .sidebar{transform:translateX(calc(-1 * var(--sidebar-w)));}
  .sidebar.open{transform:none;box-shadow:4px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}
  .topnav{left:0;}
  .main{margin-left:0;}
  .hamburger{display:flex;}
  .parties-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .sig-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .member-details-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  .doc-body{padding:20px;}
  .doc-toc{padding:14px 20px 0;}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .main{padding:14px;}
  .doc-header{padding:22px 20px;}
  .doc-body{padding:16px;}
  .section-body{padding-left:0;}
  .member-details-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .status-label{display:none;}
  .topnav{padding:0 12px;gap:8px;}
  .topnav-greeting h2{font-size:13px;}
  .topnav-greeting p{display:none;}
  .doc-toc{padding:12px 16px 0;}
}
@media print{
  .sidebar,.topnav,.powered-by,.doc-actions,.breadcrumb-row,.doc-toc{display:none!important;}
  .main{margin:0;padding:0;}
  .doc-wrapper{border:none;max-width:100%;}
  body{background:white;}
  [data-theme="dark"] .doc-wrapper,
  [data-theme="dark"] .doc-body,
  [data-theme="dark"] .party-card,
  [data-theme="dark"] .sig-card,
  [data-theme="dark"] .member-sig-card{background:white!important;color:#000!important;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- LOADER -->
<div id="loader">
  <div class="ld-particles" id="ldParticles"></div>
  <div class="ld-glow"></div>

  <div class="ld-center">
    <div class="ld-ring-wrap">
      <svg class="ld-ring-svg" viewBox="0 0 58 58" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle class="ld-ring-orbit" cx="29" cy="29" r="26"/>
        <circle class="ld-ring-bg"    cx="29" cy="29" r="20"/>
        <circle class="ld-ring-arc"   cx="29" cy="29" r="20" transform="rotate(-90 29 29)"/>
        <circle class="ld-ring-dot"   cx="29" cy="9"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="ld-ring-letter">C</div>
    </div>

    <div class="ld-brand">
      <div class="ld-word">
        <span class="ldl w" style="--ld:1.05s">C</span>
        <span class="ldl w" style="--ld:1.13s">l</span>
        <span class="ldl w" style="--ld:1.21s">o</span>
        <span class="ldl w" style="--ld:1.29s">u</span>
        <span class="ldl w" style="--ld:1.37s">d</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ld-word-gap"></div>
      <div class="ld-word">
        <span class="ldl a" style="--ld:1.48s">B</span>
        <span class="ldl a" style="--ld:1.56s">A</span>
        <span class="ldl a" style="--ld:1.64s">A</span>
        <span class="ldl a" style="--ld:1.72s">M</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%
  const pendingGuarantorCount = user.guarantorRequests
    ? user.guarantorRequests.filter(r => r.status === "pending").length : 0;
  const signatureSrc = user.signature
    ? user.signature.replace('public\\', '/').replace(/\\/g, '/')
    : null;
  const chairmanName = chairman ? `${chairman.firstName} ${chairman.lastName}` : "Authorized Signatory";
  const chairmanSignatureSrc = (chairman && chairman.officialSignature && chairman.officialSignature.url)
    ? chairman.officialSignature.url
    : null;
%>

<div class="sb-overlay" id="sbOverlay" onclick="closeSidebar()"></div>

<!-- ════ SIDEBAR ════ -->
<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="sidebar-logo">
    <div class="logo-mark">
      <img src="/media/assets/logo/log.png" alt="Logo"
           onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentNode.innerHTML='<b>C</b>'">
    </div>
    <div style="min-width:0;">
      <div class="logo-name">Club De Stars</div>
      <div class="logo-sub">Cooperative Society</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sidebar-user">
    <div class="user-chip">
      <div class="user-avatar">
        <%= user.firstName.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %><%= user.lastName.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
      </div>
      <div style="min-width:0;">
        <div class="user-name"><%= user.firstName %> <%= user.lastName %></div>
        <div class="user-id"><%= user.membershipID %></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="sidebar-nav">
    <div class="nav-section">Menu</div>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/dashboard" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/transaction" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-exchange-alt"></i> Transactions</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/loan" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-coins"></i> Loans</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/guarantorRequest" class="nav-item">
      <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i> Guarantor
      <% if (pendingGuarantorCount > 0) { %><span class="nav-badge"><%= pendingGuarantorCount %></span><% } %>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-section">Account</div>
    <a href="/manage/kiddies-account" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-baby"></i> Kiddies Account</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/profile" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> Profile</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/kyc" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> KYC</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/referral" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> Referrals</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/report" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Reports</a>
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/memberContract" class="nav-item active"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i> Terms</a>
    <% if (user.role && user.role.name !== 'member') { %>
    <div class="nav-section">Admin</div>
    <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt"></i> Administration</a>
    <% } %>
  </nav>
  <div class="sidebar-footer">
    <div class="member-pill">
      <i class="fas fa-star" style="font-size:9px;"></i>
      <%= user.membershipID.startsWith('CD') ? 'Club Member' : 'Associate Member' %>
    </div>
    <a href="/logout" class="nav-item" style="color:var(--red);margin-top:2px;">
      <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Sign Out
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>

<!-- ════ TOP NAV ════ -->
<header class="topnav">
  <button class="hamburger" onclick="toggleSidebar()" aria-label="Menu">
    <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
  </button>
  <div class="topnav-greeting">
    <h2>Membership Agreement</h2>
    <p>Terms &amp; Conditions · MOU · Bylaws · Privacy</p>
  </div>
  <div class="topnav-right">
    <div class="status-row">
      <div class="status-dot"></div>
      <span class="status-label">Active</span>
    </div>
    <% if (user.Payment && user.Payment.status === "paid") { %>
      <div class="kyc-chip verified">
        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="font-size:11px;"></i>
        <span>Verified</span>
      </div>
    <% } else { %>
      <a href="/cds-cooperative/kyc" class="kyc-chip">
        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="font-size:11px;"></i>
        <span>KYC</span>
      </a>
    <% } %>
    <button class="theme-toggle" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Toggle theme" aria-label="Toggle light/dark mode">
      <div class="tog-thumb" id="togThumb">
        <i class="fas fa-moon" id="togIcon" style="font-size:9px;"></i>
      </div>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ════ MAIN ════ -->
<main class="main">

  <div class="breadcrumb-row">
    <a href="/cds-cooperative/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
    <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i>
    <span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-wrapper">

    <!-- Document Header -->
    <div class="doc-header">
      <div class="doc-header-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i></div>
      <h1>MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING</h1>
      <p>Membership Agreement · Bylaws · Terms of Use · Privacy Policy</p>
      <div class="doc-meta-row">
        <span class="doc-meta-chip">
          <i class="fas fa-registered" style="font-size:10px;"></i>
          Reg. No: BN/CRCS/14864
        </span>
        <span class="doc-meta-chip">
          <i class="fas fa-calendar" style="font-size:10px;"></i>
          Effective: 16 March 2025
        </span>
        <span class="doc-meta-chip">
          <i class="fas fa-id-card" style="font-size:10px;"></i>
          <%= user.membershipID %>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick jump -->
    <div class="doc-toc">
      <a href="#part-mou">MOU</a>
      <a href="#part-bylaws">Bylaws</a>
      <a href="#part-terms">Terms of Use</a>
      <a href="#part-privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="#part-signatures">Signatures</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Document Body -->
    <div class="doc-body">

      <!-- Parties -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:28px;" id="part-mou">
        <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;">Parties to this Agreement</div>

        <div class="parties-grid">
          <div class="party-card a">
            <div class="party-tag a"><i class="fas fa-building" style="font-size:10px;"></i> The Cooperative</div>
            <div class="party-name">Club De Stars Multipurpose Cooperative Society Limited</div>
            <div class="party-desc">A duly registered cooperative under the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria, having its registered office at Makurdi, Benue State.</div>
            <span class="party-ref a">Reg. BN/CRCS/14864</span>
          </div>
          <div class="party-card b">
            <div class="party-tag b"><i class="fas fa-user" style="font-size:10px;"></i> The Member</div>
            <div class="party-name"><%= user.firstName %> <%= user.lastName %></div>
            <div class="party-desc">Residing at <strong><%= user.address %>, <%= user.lga %>, <%= user.state %> State, Nigeria.</strong></div>
            <span class="party-ref b">ID: <%= user.membershipID %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══════════ PART I — MOU ═══════════ -->

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">1</div>
          <div class="section-title">Purpose of the MOU</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>This Memorandum of Understanding outlines the terms and conditions of the relationship between the Cooperative and the Member regarding their rights, responsibilities, and obligations. These Terms govern the relationship between members and Club De Stars Multi-Purpose Cooperative Society Ltd., designed to promote mutual cooperation and shared benefits.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">2</div>
          <div class="section-title">Membership Obligations</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>Membership is open to individuals who meet the criteria set forth by the cooperative, as determined by the Board of Directors. The Member agrees to:</p>
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>Adhere to the Cooperative's bylaws, policies, and regulations, pay annual dues, and contribute to the cooperative's objectives through active participation.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>Participate in Cooperative activities, meetings, and decision-making processes.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span>Contribute financially as per the Cooperative's share capital and savings requirements.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">d</div><span>Uphold the values and principles of cooperation, mutual support, and good faith.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">3</div>
          <div class="section-title">Rights and Benefits of the Member</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>The Member is entitled to:</p>
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>Participate in profit-sharing or dividends as per the Cooperative's policies.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>Vote and be elected to the Cooperative's leadership positions, if eligible.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span>Access loans, credit facilities, and other services provided by the Cooperative.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">d</div><span>Receive training, education, and support from the Cooperative.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">4</div>
          <div class="section-title">Financial Contributions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>The Member shall contribute:</p>
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>A membership fee of <strong>₦5,000</strong> upon joining the Cooperative.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>A minimum share capital contribution of <strong>₦1,000</strong> as per Cooperative policy.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">5</div>
          <div class="section-title">Termination of Membership</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>Membership may be terminated by:</p>
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>Voluntary withdrawal, provided the Member gives 30 days' notice.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>Failure to fulfill financial obligations or breach of Cooperative policies.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span>Expulsion by the Board due to misconduct, fraud, or violation of Cooperative principles.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">6</div>
          <div class="section-title">Dispute Resolution</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>Any dispute arising from this MOU shall first be resolved through dialogue and mediation within the Cooperative. If unresolved, the matter shall be referred to arbitration as per applicable law and the Cooperative Act.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">7</div>
          <div class="section-title">Duration and Review</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>This MOU shall remain in effect for the duration of the Member's active participation in the Cooperative and may be reviewed periodically by the Board of Directors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">8</div>
          <div class="section-title">Miscellaneous Provisions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>This MOU does not create an employer-employee relationship between the parties.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>Amendments to this MOU shall be made in writing and agreed upon by both parties.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span>The cooperative will hold meetings when need arises to discuss operations, financial performance, and future initiatives. Members will receive prior notice of all meetings.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══════════ PART II — BYLAWS ═══════════ -->
      <div class="part-divider" id="part-bylaws">
        <div class="line"></div>
        <span class="part-label"><i class="fas fa-book" style="font-size:10px;"></i> Part II — Bylaws of the Cooperative</span>
        <div class="line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">9</div>
          <div class="section-title">Membership</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>Membership shall be opened to Club and Non-club members:</p>
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span><strong>Club Members</strong> — Registered members of Club De Stars Worldwide.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span><strong>Non-Club Members</strong> — Family, friends and associates of members of Club De Stars Worldwide.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span><strong>Registration Fee</strong> — Membership registration shall be ₦5,000 for all categories of members.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">d</div><span><strong>Account Categories</strong> — <strong>Adult:</strong> members must be 18 years and above. <strong>Kiddies:</strong> for minors aged 1 month to 17 years, with the account opened and managed by a parent or guardian. Withdrawal tenure is a minimum of five (5) years, except in cases of death, permanent insanity, or a critical medical condition supported by a medical report from a registered hospital. The ROI on Kiddies Accounts is calculated using the same formula as other accounts, and the account may be upgraded to an adult account once the holder turns 18, upon submission of an upgrade application with a valid birth certificate or declaration of age. No loans shall be advanced on Kiddies Accounts.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 10 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">10</div>
          <div class="section-title">Contributions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>Savings shall be made at any time, with a minimum of ₦1,000.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>Savings shall be deposited into the Cooperative's designated account provided by the operating company with proper narration.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span>The Cooperative's financial year shall run from December 1st to November 30th.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 11 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">11</div>
          <div class="section-title">Withdrawals</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p><strong>On Demand Withdrawal</strong> — withdrawal outside the statutory window period set aside by the Cooperative.</p>
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>Applications for withdrawal of savings shall be processed within thirty (30) days of submission.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>Withdrawals shall be limited to two batches per financial year: a <strong>first withdrawal</strong> of up to 50% of total savings (subject to a 2.5% service charge), and a <strong>second withdrawal</strong> of the balance of savings after 30 days (also subject to a 2.5% service charge).</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><strong>Open-Window Withdrawal</strong> — withdrawal within the statutory window period (December 1st – December 10th). Members shall send their application from the 1st day of December to the 10th of December.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 12 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">12</div>
          <div class="section-title">Loans</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span><strong>Eligibility</strong> — An applicant must have been a member for at least one (1) month. Loans shall be advanced up to a maximum of three (3) times the applicant's total savings. Two guarantors are required for the loan to be approved.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span><strong>Loan Tenor and Interest Rates</strong> — One Month Loan: 3% for Club Members, 7% for Non-Club Members.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span><strong>Loan Rollover</strong> — Upon expiration of loan tenor, members may roll over to the next month (unlimited) if a fresh loan application is submitted for the same amount. Official rollovers attract an extra 1%, applicable only once irrespective of the number of rollovers.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">d</div><span><strong>Default Penalties</strong> — Loans not refunded within 30 days attract 0.5% of the outstanding amount for each extra day. Management may liquidate a member's savings to offset outstanding loans. Upon notification, part of a guarantor's savings may be used to settle an outstanding loan, and at year-end management reserves the right to deduct from guarantors' savings without prior approval if loans remain unpaid.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">e</div><span><strong>Disbursement</strong> — Loans shall be disbursed only into accounts bearing the applicant's full name.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">f</div><span><strong>Priority</strong> — Loans shall be granted on a first-come, first-served basis, subject to funds availability.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 13 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">13</div>
          <div class="section-title">Profit and Surplus Distribution</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span><strong>Service Fee</strong> — Fifteen percent (15%) of total profit generated annually shall be paid to the operating company as service fee, remitted monthly on a pro-rata basis upon submission of invoice and approval by Cooperative management.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span><strong>Operating Surplus</strong> — At the end of each financial year, all surplus funds shall be remitted to Club De Stars Worldwide, with 15% of the surplus given to the operating company.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span><strong>Profit Sharing</strong> — Profit shall be calculated monthly but distributed only at the end of each financial year, based on total savings.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 14 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">14</div>
          <div class="section-title">Investments</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>The Cooperative shall invest in low-risk, profit-generating portfolios to ensure sustainability and growth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 15 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">15</div>
          <div class="section-title">General Provisions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>Members may instruct management to liquidate their savings to offset outstanding loan balances.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>The Cooperative reserves the right to review interest rates, service fees, and investment policies periodically at an AGM.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">c</div><span>Every member shall maintain a minimum share capital of ₦10,000. Should a member decide to liquidate their savings below the minimum share capital, such account will be considered closed and the member will be required to re-register.</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">d</div><span>Newly registered members are mandated to fund their accounts with the minimum share capital of ₦10,000 within one month of registration, else such account will be deactivated or re-assigned.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 16 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">16</div>
          <div class="section-title">Annual General Meeting / Special General Meeting</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="clause-list">
            <li><div class="clause-marker">a</div><span>The Annual General Meeting shall hold once a year in the last week of November (Management shall determine the actual day).</span></li>
            <li><div class="clause-marker">b</div><span>A Special General Meeting shall be held when the need arises.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══════════ PART III — TERMS OF USE ═══════════ -->
      <div class="part-divider" id="part-terms">
        <div class="line"></div>
        <span class="part-label"><i class="fas fa-file-contract" style="font-size:10px;"></i> Part III — Terms &amp; Conditions of Use</span>
        <div class="line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 17 -->
      <div class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-num">17</div>
          <div class="section-title">Acceptance of Terms</div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body">
